{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在上半屏左侧的大号白色文字，字号最大、亮度最高，紫色竖线进一步强化入口；右上角目录和下方音符动画都是次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只抓到一个人没藏住对另一个人的喜欢，被对方看出了在乎；之后双方的相处处境不完整。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不确定。第一眼容易看到喜欢被看出来，但空落落、害怕被嫌弃等核心感受需要继续读。\",\n  \"missed\": \"被看穿心意后的不安和空落落；害怕自己太黏而被嫌弃；原本亲近的两人突然产生距离感；最后对幸福的疑问和如释重负的感觉。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里包含藏着喜欢、心意暴露、害怕被嫌弃、亲近感消失、幸福感与释然等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心感受出现在长段落中后部，不能仅凭开头几行直接获得。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3a5d78c4-89c7-481e-8081-ac2d0f6e0abd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014543612363Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:46:23.687747+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "369cc4e3e407fe59170bcf5b376115e9181f6944b242b4fe78500405d1d969b9", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool